{"4590870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Barrow Bros", "steam_appid": 4590870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was supposed to be just another job. Then the well started filling up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Barrow Bros is a physics-based co-op adventure for two. Grab a friend — one of you pushes, one of you steers — and race to the top of a collapsing well before the rising water swallows you both. Miscommunicate for even a second, and you'll both be finding out the hard way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4590870/extras/59c9ce3dc67ec6a37d0f058ec98413f7.poster.avif?t=1787392755\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4590870/extras/59c9ce3dc67ec6a37d0f058ec98413f7.webm?t=1787392755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4590870/extras/59c9ce3dc67ec6a37d0f058ec98413f7.mp4?t=1787392755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One pushes. One steers.</strong><br>Player One controls movement, jumps, dashes, and can drop glowing markers to remember the path through the dark. Player Two steers the wheelbarrow, wields a flashlight to light the way, and swings a shovel to fend off whatever's down here. Success means constantly talking to each other — or constantly yelling, whichever comes first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4590870/extras/0dee1d3f66b405f8feb67a3e6bc51761.poster.avif?t=1787392755\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4590870/extras/0dee1d3f66b405f8feb67a3e6bc51761.webm?t=1787392755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4590870/extras/0dee1d3f66b405f8feb67a3e6bc51761.mp4?t=1787392755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The water never stops.</strong><br>There's no pausing the rise. Every wrong turn, every wasted second in a dead-end cave costs you — and the water doesn't care how lost you are. Find the right path or watch it close in behind you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4590870/extras/e36e67e623738d63050c323c5ae861d4.poster.avif?t=1787392755\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4590870/extras/e36e67e623738d63050c323c5ae861d4.webm?t=1787392755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4590870/extras/e36e67e623738d63050c323c5ae861d4.mp4?t=1787392755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Descend through rooms that want you dead.</strong><br>Every run takes you through a different gauntlet of underground rooms — a lava chamber guarded by a rock monster hurling boulders at your head, a mine field where one wrong step ends the run, a maze crawling with crocodiles, and caves haunted by something watching your every move. Learn the rooms, or don't survive them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4590870/extras/20e0f3c9375dc1e9b8c24b0d84eee75a.poster.avif?t=1787392755\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4590870/extras/20e0f3c9375dc1e9b8c24b0d84eee75a.webm?t=1787392755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4590870/extras/20e0f3c9375dc1e9b8c24b0d84eee75a.mp4?t=1787392755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wrong turn? Start losing.</strong><br>The caves branch constantly, and only some paths lead up. Guess wrong and you'll waste precious time backtracking while the water keeps climbing — communication and memory are just as important as reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4590870/extras/8cb619f8054eb77998c0bb6707fe45dc.poster.avif?t=1787392755\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4590870/extras/8cb619f8054eb77998c0bb6707fe45dc.webm?t=1787392755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4590870/extras/8cb619f8054eb77998c0bb6707fe45dc.mp4?t=1787392755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo or co-op.</strong><br>Play local or online co-op and split the roles with a friend, or go it alone and juggle both jobs yourself if you think you're up to it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4590870/extras/49b30a8c4e5012d7c965cc4d719399f7.poster.avif?t=1787392755\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4590870/extras/49b30a8c4e5012d7c965cc4d719399f7.webm?t=1787392755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4590870/extras/49b30a8c4e5012d7c965cc4d719399f7.mp4?t=1787392755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make them yours.</strong><br>Before you head back down, customize your worker — reshape their body, arms, stomach, legs, and head, swap head styles, and recolor everything. Whether you want your co-op partner to look like a tank or a noodle, the well doesn't care how ridiculous you look going under.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4590870/extras/af62879dc18d76bfe7efe0b9bf9d5533.poster.avif?t=1787392755\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4590870/extras/af62879dc18d76bfe7efe0b9bf9d5533.webm?t=1787392755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4590870/extras/af62879dc18d76bfe7efe0b9bf9d5533.mp4?t=1787392755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One pushes. One steers. Both panic.</strong> Split the jobs or juggle them solo — miscommunicate for one second and you're both going under.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The water never waits.</strong> No pauses, no mercy. Every wrong turn and dead-end cave brings the flood closer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every run is a different gauntlet.</strong> Lava chambers, crocodile mazes, minefields, ghost rooms — the well has teeth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make them yours.</strong> Reshape body, arms, legs, swap heads, recolor everything. Look ridiculous. Die ridiculous.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Couch, online, or across the world.</strong> Local co-op, online co-op, Remote Play, or solo. However you play, bring a friend or be both.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was supposed to be just another job. Then the well started filling up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Barrow Bros is a physics-based co-op adventure for two. Grab a friend — one of you pushes, one of you steers — and race to the top of a collapsing well before the rising water swallows you both. Miscommunicate for even a second, and you'll both be finding out the hard way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4590870/extras/59c9ce3dc67ec6a37d0f058ec98413f7.poster.avif?t=1787392755\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4590870/extras/59c9ce3dc67ec6a37d0f058ec98413f7.webm?t=1787392755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4590870/extras/59c9ce3dc67ec6a37d0f058ec98413f7.mp4?t=1787392755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One pushes. One steers.</strong><br>Player One controls movement, jumps, dashes, and can drop glowing markers to remember the path through the dark. Player Two steers the wheelbarrow, wields a flashlight to light the way, and swings a shovel to fend off whatever's down here. Success means constantly talking to each other — or constantly yelling, whichever comes first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4590870/extras/0dee1d3f66b405f8feb67a3e6bc51761.poster.avif?t=1787392755\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4590870/extras/0dee1d3f66b405f8feb67a3e6bc51761.webm?t=1787392755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.a