 other steer, panic, repeat — solo or co-op, outrun the rise or go under.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Dutch, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Thai, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4590870/9ccec0dd88de87a0b59b31b1e149f99f4d4fc4fd/header.jpg?t=1787392755", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4590870/30601add9962a41af640139b3e9c5e02ede2bdf4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787392755", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4590870/30601add9962a41af640139b3e9c5e02ede2bdf4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787392755", "website": "https://www.syzoz.com/PressKit", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 or AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 750 Ti or AMD Radeon R7 260X<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-6700 or AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 or AMD RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11 Big Sur<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or I